  "excluded_deliberately": {
    "_comment": "Tokens considered and rejected, recorded so they don't get re-added later.",
    "sg": "Appears in a large share of legitimate Singaporean domains. As a keyword it would fire on almost everything; as an affix token it would mis-split constantly. It is still useful as a per-brand context_token, where it is scoped.",
    "online": "Too common in legitimate business domains to carry signal.",
    "app": "Same. Also collides with the .app TLD.",
    "my": "Prefix of many legitimate product domains (myinfo, myrepublic) including watched brands.",
    "web": "No signal.",
    "new": "No signal, and collides with legitimate 'new-' product launches."
